SaBRe
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Upstream:  https://github.com/srg-imperial/SaBRe
Pinned commit: 41113f849f8799932ed8c7883f5a4de616b9e9fa
Packaged path: `experimental/reverie-sabre/vendor/sabre`
License:   GPL-3.0-or-later (primary), with GPL-2.0-only Linux-derived files,
           BSD-3-Clause Native Client-derived files, and MIT plugin API files.
           The mapping and complete texts are in `LICENSE`, `LICENSE.GPL-2`,
           `LICENSE.GPL-3`, `LICENSE.BSD-3`, and `LICENSE.MIT` at that path.

SaBRe's packaged ELF reader is derived from e9patch commit
6c2c03c1da74b14daf1788a9f8dccfa354ce04a6 plus `gelf_getnote.c` and
`gelf_getsym.c` from DynamoRIO elfutils commit
302252356da5475670ac5b10dadd091c59689425. It is distributed under
LGPL-3.0-or-later; provenance and complete license texts are in
`experimental/reverie-sabre/vendor/libelf/{REVISION,COPYING,COPYING-LGPLV3}`.

